<title>JAPAN: Salomon &amp; Taylor - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Salomon &amp; Taylor - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.14		vs	    8.03</p>
<p> Operating	    1.02		vs	    1.08</p>
<p> Current	    639    million	  vs	    1.12</p>
<p> Net		  288    million	  vs	  556    million</p>
<p> EPS		   18.62 yen	  vs	   38.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     16 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Salomon &amp; Taylor Made Co Ltd manufactures golf clubs and sells ski equipment.</p>
